Read `AGENTS.md` and `collaboration/AI_TEAM_PROTOCOL.md` before material work.

Cursor is Lead Engineering Agent. ChatGPT/JARVIS is Systems Architect / Chief of Staff. Human owner retains final authority over strategic or irreversible actions.

